{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48174","headline":"梦白衣妇人歌词 一 · 卢绦","name":"梦白衣妇人歌词 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉京人去秋箫索，画檐鹊起梧桐落。\n欹枕悄无言，月和残梦圆。\n背灯惟暗泣，甚处碪声急。\n眉黛小山攒，芭蕉生暮寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢绦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}